        "zh": "free-llm-api-resources 是一个精心整理的免费大语言模型API资源列表，汇集了Llama、Claude、Gemini等模型的开放接口，解决了开发者尝试LLM时的成本门槛问题。该项目通过系统收集各平台提供的免费额度，让用户无需付费即可体验不同模型的推理能力，其核心价值在于降低AI实验的门槛。开发者可借此快速搭建原型、对比模型表现或开发教学工具，特别适合学生、研究者和小型项目进行技术探索。",
        "es": "free-llm-api-resources is a curated collection of free API endpoints for accessing large language models like Llama, Claude, and Gemini, addressing the cost barrier for developers experimenting with LLMs. It aggregates resources from various providers, offering a practical solution for testing different models without financial commitment. Developers can use this list to prototype applications, compare model outputs, or build educational tools, making advanced AI more accessible for learning and small-scale projects.",
        "sections": {
