        "es": "gh-aw is a GitHub extension that automates complex development workflows using AI agents, addressing the challenge of managing repetitive coding tasks. It leverages Claude Code and Codex models to interpret natural language instructions and execute multi-step operations like code generation, testing, and deployment. Developers can integrate it into CI/CD pipelines or use it locally via CLI to automate code reviews, dependency updates, or documentation generation, making it practical for streamlining software maintenance.",
