      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking is a massive vision-language model that understands both images and text to generate coherent responses, addressing the challenge of multimodal AI reasoning. Its technical innovation lies in a mixture-of-experts architecture with 235 billion parameters, where specialized sub-networks activate based on input type, enabling efficient processing of complex visual-textual tasks. Researchers can fine-tune it for applications like visual question answering, document analysis, or creative storytelling by leveraging its conversational capabilities through Hugging Face's transformers library.",
        "zh": "Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Thinking 是一个大型视觉语言模型，能够同时理解图像和文本并生成连贯回应，解决了多模态AI推理的难题。其技术核心采用2350亿参数的混合专家架构，根据输入类型激活特定子网络，从而高效处理复杂的视觉文本任务。开发者可通过Hugging Face的transformers库进行微调，应用于视觉问答、文档分析或创意叙事等场景，探索其在多模态对话中的实际潜力。",
