        "zh": "Nomic-embed-text-v1 是一款开源的文本嵌入模型，能够将句子转换为有意义的数值向量，用于语义相似度计算等任务。其技术核心在于采用改进的BERT架构并结合对比学习训练，使模型不仅能捕捉表面词汇匹配，还能理解深层的语义关联。开发者可通过sentence-transformers库轻松调用该模型，应用于语义搜索、文档聚类或推荐系统等场景，为研究和实际项目提供高效的文本表示方案。",
        "es": "Nomic-embed-text-v1 is an open-source text embedding model that converts sentences into meaningful numerical vectors for semantic similarity tasks. Its technical innovation lies in using a modified BERT architecture with contrastive learning, enabling it to capture nuanced semantic relationships beyond simple keyword matching. Developers can easily integrate it via the sentence-transformers library for applications like semantic search, document clustering, or recommendation systems, making it practical for both research and production environments.",
